<https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000035> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000032> ;
    skos:definition "The term shellfish is used both broadly and specifically. For regulatory purposes it is often narrowly defined as filter-feeding molluscs such as clams, mussels, and oyster to the exclusion of crustaceans and all else. Although their shells may differ, all shellfish are invertebrates."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/era-aom/scheme/livestock-v2> ;
