<https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000024> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Fowl"@en,
        "Game Birds"@en ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000003> ;
    skos:definition "Poultry are domesticated birds kept by humans for their eggs, their meat or their feathers. These birds are most typically members of the superorder Galloanserae (fowl), especially the order Galliformes (which includes chickens, quails, and turkeys). The term also includes birds that are killed for their meat, such as the young of pigeons (known as squabs). Game birds are similar wild birds hunted for sport or food [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Poultry]."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/era-aom/scheme/livestock-v2> ;
    skos:narrower <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000025>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000026>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000027>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000028>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000029>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000030>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000031> ;
    skos:notation "AOM_000024" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Poultry or Game Bird"@en ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411563>,
        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8782> ;
    era:conceptType "legacy_aom_concept" ;
    era:status "unknown" .

<https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000300> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_001062> ;
    skos:definition "A digestibility measurement method is a systematic, scientifically-based approach used to assess the proportion of nutrients in a livestock feed that can be effectively broken down and absorbed by an animal's digestive system. These methods typically involve the collection and analysis of feed and fecal samples, and may include in vivo techniques, such as direct or indirect digestibility assays, or in vitro techniques, such as enzyme or microbial-based assays. The objective is to evaluate the efficiency of nutrient utilization from the feed, informing decisions on optimizing animal nutrition strategies. (HV GPT4)"@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/era-aom/scheme/livestock-v2> ;
    skos:narrower <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000287>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000289>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000290>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_001063>,
        <https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_001064>,
